# GLOBAL SEARCH
###################

### Global Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/search/global?query=chicken&limit=20 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Search Suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/search/suggestions?query=chi&type=items HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

###################
# ERROR LOGGING
###################

### Log Error (Authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/errors HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
    "message": "Database connection failed",
    "level": "error",
    "context": {
        "user_id": 1,
        "action": "create_order",
        "trace": "Stack trace here..."
    }
}

### Log Error Batch (Authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/errors/batch HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
    "errors": [
        {
            "message": "Validation failed",
            "level": "warning",
            "context": {"field": "email"}
        },
        {
            "message": "API timeout",
            "level": "error",
            "context": {"endpoint": "/api/orders"}
        }
    ]
}

### Get Error Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/errors/stats?period=week&level=error HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Log Public Error (Unauthenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/errors/public HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "message": "Frontend JavaScript error",
    "level": "error",
    "context": {
        "url": "/dashboard",
        "browser": "Chrome 118.0.0.0",
        "error": "TypeError: Cannot read property 'length' of undefined"
    }
}

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/errors/health HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json